    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like i'm \"trying\" tho. it just feels like i'm a black hole. my partner is working two jobs just to keep us afloat because i can't... and everything i do just makes it more expensive or more stressful. i look at my kid and i just think, if i wasn't in the picture, things would actually be easier for them. they wouldn't have to deal with my mess.",
